@startuml ref-singleton
!include _style.puml
title Singleton - GoF Reference Structure\n(Source: Gamma, Helm, Johnson, Vlissides. Design Patterns. Addison-Wesley, 1995)
class Singleton {
  -{static} instance: Singleton
  -Singleton()
  +{static} getInstance(): Singleton
  +operation()
}
Singleton ..> Singleton : returns sole instance
note bottom of Singleton : Private ctor.\nOne instance, global access point.
@enduml
